1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
Did you bring that up during the interview?

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,120
Who do you think will get married first?

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,120
Huh? Where?

4
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,680
And you just stayed silent?

5
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:06,840
You didn't answer?

6
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,200
What did you say?

7
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,560
First place, Yoo-jung?

8
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:10,560
Me?

9
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,640
First place, Yoo-jung?

10
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,640
Me?

11
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,360
Really?

12
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,720
Why me?

13
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:14,840
Why, why, why, why?

14
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:15,960
Seriously?

15
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:16,960
Why me?

16
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,040
Why, why, why, why?

17
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,520
I'm the youngest, so why?

18
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:25,000
I thought Yoo-jung was dating the best and would settle down first.

19
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,280
So who do you think will get married last?

20
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,720
The one who'll be last?

21
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,300
Why not?

22
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,960
Why does it feel like...

23
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:43,280
I don't see anyone who'd give off that vibe.

24
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,780
It'd feel weird.

25
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:48,280
If we said one of us is getting married...

26
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:50,860
Then I'm getting married ten years later, right?

27
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:53,160
Since I'm first.

28
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,160
I suddenly imagined...

29
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:57,500
I wish we all lived next door to each other.

30
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,160
I've mentioned this before.

31
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:02,800
Looking after the kids, going out together...

32
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:07,540
For our 20th anniversary trip, we'd all be with our kids, right?

33
00:01:07,540 --> 00:01:08,840
How old would they be?

34
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,040
Yoo-jung would be in her 30s.

35
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,080
Mid-30s.

36
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:12,360
46 years old.

37
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:13,500
Wow.

38
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,880
Stay healthy, hyung.

39
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:18,140
You really need to take care of your health.

40
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:26,503
But the clothes... The boat we're taking today might be Jinyoung-hyung's. It could be his boat. Why? These glasses...

41
00:01:30,003 --> 00:01:31,283
It's transforming!

42
00:01:31,283 --> 00:01:32,283
Ah, Captain!

43
00:01:32,803 --> 00:01:34,783
It's really fine, Captain.

44
00:01:34,783 --> 00:01:36,343
Ah, that's funny.

45
00:01:36,343 --> 00:01:37,343
Oh my, you're here!

46
00:01:37,343 --> 00:01:38,883
Yes!

47
00:01:38,883 --> 00:01:40,743
Oh, thank you so much!

48
00:01:44,223 --> 00:01:45,783
Grilling meat this early in the morning!

49
00:01:46,723 --> 00:01:47,923
It must be delicious.

50
00:01:48,563 --> 00:01:50,563
Oh, it turned out great.

51
00:01:50,563 --> 00:01:52,563
This looks way too salty.

52
00:01:54,563 --> 00:01:56,563
Oh, that stir-fried octopus looks delicious.

53
00:01:58,563 --> 00:02:00,563
There's so much of it.

54
00:02:00,563 --> 00:02:02,563
Do we need to take a lot of photos?

55
00:02:02,563 --> 00:02:04,563
Okay, listen up.

56
00:02:04,563 --> 00:02:06,563
One, two, three.

57
00:02:06,563 --> 00:02:08,563
Done.

58
00:02:08,563 --> 00:02:10,563
Woo! What did you order?

59
00:02:10,563 --> 00:02:12,563
Enjoy your meal.

60
00:02:12,563 --> 00:02:14,563
Let's dig in.

61
00:02:18,563 --> 00:02:19,563
Is it good?

62
00:02:19,063 --> 00:02:20,063
Mmm!

63
00:02:22,823 --> 00:02:24,323
As expected, Gangwon's beef is the best.

64
00:02:24,323 --> 00:02:25,323
Really?

65
00:02:28,103 --> 00:02:29,103
Wow.

66
00:02:30,423 --> 00:02:31,423
It's delicious.

67
00:02:31,123 --> 00:02:32,123
Yeah.

68
00:02:32,163 --> 00:02:33,163
It's really good.

69
00:02:48,563 --> 00:02:54,026
Do you remember the day we did the full script reading?

70
00:02:54,026 --> 00:02:55,026
Everyone?

71
00:02:54,586 --> 00:02:55,686
I wasn't there.

72
00:02:55,686 --> 00:02:56,686
I remember it.

73
00:02:56,566 --> 00:02:57,566
Dong-hyun wasn't there.

74
00:02:57,366 --> 00:02:59,386
I even remember what I was wearing.

75
00:02:59,386 --> 00:03:00,386
Huh?

76
00:02:59,766 --> 00:03:00,866
So what were you wearing?

77
00:03:00,866 --> 00:03:01,866
A white shirt.

78
00:03:01,866 --> 00:03:03,966
I think I was wearing a white shirt too.

79
00:03:03,966 --> 00:03:04,966
I was wearing a white shirt too.

80
00:03:04,866 --> 00:03:06,786
I think I was wearing a white shirt too?

81
00:03:06,786 --> 00:03:12,926
I was just wearing white at home.

82
00:03:12,926 --> 00:03:21,846
That's when I was cursing Director Seong-yoon a bit.

83
00:03:21,846 --> 00:03:22,846
Why?

84
00:03:23,646 --> 00:03:26,046
Because I had worked with him before, so we were close.

85
00:03:26,046 --> 00:03:27,866
I realized I had to go through an audition too.

86
00:03:27,866 --> 00:03:29,926
But they didn't call me for an audition.

87
00:03:29,926 --> 00:03:31,706
They just called me.

88
00:03:31,706 --> 00:03:33,246
I asked why they weren't giving me an audition.

89
00:03:33,246 --> 00:03:34,726
What did you know?

90
00:03:34,726 --> 00:03:37,526
They were like, "Why would we audition you? We already know you." So...

91
00:03:37,526 --> 00:03:38,726
They said no.

92
00:03:38,726 --> 00:03:41,226
I took a taxi to the office.

93
00:03:41,226 --> 00:03:42,726
Wow, that's cool.

94
00:03:42,726 --> 00:03:46,726
No, Byung-hyun said he wanted to do it.

95
00:03:46,726 --> 00:03:50,726
But they said no, right? And then I cursed him at home.

96
00:03:50,726 --> 00:03:52,726
So I must have been wearing white, like a mourning robe.

97
00:03:54,726 --> 00:03:57,726
Then, after they contacted me to join, I immediately canceled the curse.

98
00:03:57,726 --> 00:03:59,726
The opposite.

99
00:03:59,726 --> 00:04:01,726
Do you remember that?

100
00:04:01,726 --> 00:04:04,126
Before that, I was young, so I called everyone "uncle."

101
00:04:04,126 --> 00:04:19,688
I felt awkward calling anyone "oppa," so I never used it. I called you "hyung" or "Mr. Bo-geum." Do you remember how we called each other "Yoo-jung-nim" and "Bo-geum-nim" at first? But then people told me to call you "Bo-geum oppa."

102
00:04:19,688 --> 00:04:22,688
You were the only person I ever called "oppa."

103
00:04:22,688 --> 00:04:24,688
So back then...

104
00:04:24,688 --> 00:04:26,688
Aside from you, oppa...

105
00:04:26,688 --> 00:04:28,688
That feels good, man.

106
00:04:28,688 --> 00:04:30,688
I feel like drinking makgeolli.

107
00:04:30,688 --> 00:04:32,688
Let's buy some at the mart later.

108
00:04:32,688 --> 00:04:34,688
I'm in vacation mode today.

109
00:04:34,688 --> 00:04:35,688
Oh, right.

110
00:04:35,328 --> 00:04:37,028
Are you actually going to drink?

111
00:04:37,028 --> 00:04:38,028
Whoosh!

112
00:04:38,868 --> 00:04:40,348
Just the reaction.

113
00:04:40,348 --> 00:04:41,348
Wow...

114
00:04:40,968 --> 00:04:41,968
This hyung drinks...

115
00:04:41,848 --> 00:04:43,708
Have we ever drunk when we met?

116
00:04:43,708 --> 00:04:44,948
We drank a lot.

117
00:04:44,948 --> 00:04:46,608
Did I not drink that day?

118
00:04:46,608 --> 00:04:48,048
Did the three of us meet?

119
00:04:48,048 --> 00:04:49,668
You know that day we suddenly went on a rampage?

120
00:04:49,668 --> 00:04:50,668
Until dawn.

121
00:04:50,508 --> 00:04:51,508
In Busan.

122
00:04:51,248 --> 00:04:52,248
Ahh.

123
00:04:52,168 --> 00:04:53,728
It was a bit of a flash mob, right?

124
00:04:53,728 --> 00:04:54,928
Yes. Yes, it was.

125
00:04:54,928 --> 00:04:55,928
It was a flash mob.

126
00:04:55,548 --> 00:04:56,828
We must have all contacted each other?

127
00:04:56,828 --> 00:04:57,828
Yeah.

128
00:04:57,368 --> 00:04:58,368
We showed up late.

129
00:04:57,988 --> 00:05:01,568
Suddenly, oppa went on a rampage that day.

130
00:05:01,568 --> 00:05:02,568
Let's go to a second place.

131
00:05:02,308 --> 00:05:03,308
Let's go to a third place.

132
00:05:02,968 --> 00:05:05,968
Yeah, we really came home late that time.

133
00:05:05,968 --> 00:05:08,968
Was that the first time in your life you stayed out that late?

134
00:05:08,968 --> 00:05:12,968
Didn't you have a record-breaking drinking capacity that night, hyung?

135
00:05:12,968 --> 00:05:16,968
I just finished every drink.

136
00:05:16,968 --> 00:05:20,968
But the weird thing was, it was surprising that there were still open shops at that hour.

137
00:05:20,968 --> 00:05:21,968
Hyung.

138
00:05:21,968 --> 00:05:22,968
And you next to me...

139
00:05:22,968 --> 00:05:23,968
You're Nongsan, right?

140
00:05:23,968 --> 00:05:25,968
You rarely go out.

141
00:05:25,968 --> 00:05:27,968
Thank you.

142
00:05:27,968 --> 00:05:29,968
For enjoying being with us.

143
00:05:29,968 --> 00:05:31,968
I do enjoy it.

144
00:05:31,968 --> 00:05:33,968
It was a record-breaking day, wasn't it?
